WEBVTT

00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:08.334
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:11.906
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.906 --> 00:00:13.965
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.809 --> 00:00:18.939
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.515 --> 00:00:23.351
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.351 --> 00:00:25.478
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.254 --> 00:00:30.281
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:34.763
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:37.391
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.665 --> 00:00:41.260
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.704 --> 00:00:47.368
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.376 --> 00:00:49.878
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.878 --> 00:00:53.075
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.085
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.085 --> 00:01:01.146
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.389 --> 00:01:06.019
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.796 --> 00:01:09.286
Let's go!

00:01:12.567 --> 00:01:16.003
A GENTLEMAN'S WORD
IS HIS BOND

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.103
I won't stand for this.

00:01:21.443 --> 00:01:23.570
Ready... Go!

00:01:24.179 --> 00:01:25.313
Get 'im, Sarge!

00:01:25.313 --> 00:01:26.575
Go, Jason!

00:01:30.452 --> 00:01:31.817
Hold it, you guys!

00:01:33.455 --> 00:01:35.423
Well, well... Commander Star.

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:38.788
What brings you to
our little pig-sty?

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.687
Why is the hallway and
this room so filthy?!

00:01:43.064 --> 00:01:44.691
What's filthy?

00:01:44.799 --> 00:01:46.391
It's clean enough for us!

00:01:46.468 --> 00:01:47.730
Are you kidding?

00:01:49.003 --> 00:01:52.268
Master Sergeant Cryburn,
what's the meaning of this?!

00:01:52.841 --> 00:02:00.043
This violates article 11,
section 32 of the UPSF regs...

00:02:00.115 --> 00:02:03.915
...regarding crew
sanitation maintenance!

00:02:03.985 --> 00:02:07.921
Sorry, Commander,
but we like it this way.

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.082
It's disgusting!

00:02:10.191 --> 00:02:14.491
Hey, guys! Commander Neat-Freak
doesn't like how we do things!

00:02:23.104 --> 00:02:24.162
I don't believe it!

00:02:24.839 --> 00:02:28.434
I never thought anyone could be
that insolent and irresponsible!

00:02:40.588 --> 00:02:42.146
For heaven's sake!

00:02:44.859 --> 00:02:46.850
Whatcha doing, Yuriko?

00:02:47.262 --> 00:02:48.320
What's it look like?

00:02:48.696 --> 00:02:50.186
Jeez, you're in a bad mood.

00:03:07.015 --> 00:03:13.215
Now I see. This isnвЂ™t just
my personal problem anymore.

00:03:15.356 --> 00:03:18.493
What? Clean up the whole
Soyokaze and for 24 hours...

00:03:18.493 --> 00:03:22.862
...do things by the book
and act like gentlemen?

00:03:23.164 --> 00:03:25.462
Captain, what's the big idea?

00:03:26.401 --> 00:03:27.925
It's Commander Star's idea.

00:03:28.036 --> 00:03:29.594
Nuts to that!

00:03:30.104 --> 00:03:33.835
Look, all I want is for the crew
to clean up this filthy ship...

00:03:33.908 --> 00:03:39.369
...follow regulations,
and act like gentlemen.

00:03:40.548 --> 00:03:42.106
We're not kids, you know.

00:03:42.317 --> 00:03:47.380
If you can't manage to do this,
then you're worse than kids.

00:03:47.589 --> 00:03:48.749
Oh, yeah?!

00:03:49.824 --> 00:03:50.518
Am I wrong?

00:03:52.227 --> 00:03:56.357
Anyhow, let's all get started
on the cleanup right now.

00:03:56.864 --> 00:03:58.491
Hold on a sec.

00:04:06.107 --> 00:04:08.439
You still don't get it, Commander.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:09.474
Get what?

00:04:10.245 --> 00:04:15.114
You're too uptight!
This isn't a girls' school!

00:04:15.283 --> 00:04:19.219
We fight for a living,
so quit bugging us about this!

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:23.149
Lieutenant Andressen,
it's you who doesn't "get it."

00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:26.560
That kind of egotistical logic
doesn't work in the military!

00:04:26.628 --> 00:04:27.253
What?!

00:04:27.328 --> 00:04:30.297
Now calm down.
Let's be reasonable. Okay?

00:04:31.799 --> 00:04:34.563
All right, then how about this?

00:04:34.636 --> 00:04:36.797
We'll settle things
with a challenge.

00:04:36.971 --> 00:04:38.131
A challenge?

00:04:38.273 --> 00:04:43.267
Yeah. If the commander wins,
we'll do what she says.

00:04:43.611 --> 00:04:46.603
And if we win,
things stay the same.

00:04:47.248 --> 00:04:48.476
Well, Captain?

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:49.617
Hmm...

00:04:49.984 --> 00:04:51.884
I'm not sure if a challenge
is the best way...

00:04:51.953 --> 00:04:53.887
...to make such
an important decision.

00:04:54.489 --> 00:04:55.581
What do you guys say?

00:04:55.657 --> 00:04:57.522
We'll go along with it.

00:04:57.992 --> 00:05:00.927
Just have to make everything
a bet, don't you?

00:05:03.631 --> 00:05:05.997
All right. Name your challenge.

00:05:08.603 --> 00:05:10.093
How about arm-wrestling me?

00:05:17.912 --> 00:05:19.743
Okay, I accept.

00:05:26.187 --> 00:05:27.449
You're sure about this?

00:05:27.689 --> 00:05:30.123
You made this
ridiculous challenge...

00:05:30.191 --> 00:05:32.455
...because you never had
any intention of obeying me.

00:05:32.994 --> 00:05:35.019
Well, I'm going to make
sure you all do!

00:05:37.198 --> 00:05:41.225
I like your spirit!
I'll handicap you if you want.

00:05:41.536 --> 00:05:42.434
No, thank you.

00:05:44.005 --> 00:05:46.337
You really are a little
fireball, aren't you?

00:05:52.013 --> 00:05:53.605
Ready... Go!

00:06:20.742 --> 00:06:22.039
Go get her, Andressen!

00:06:43.731 --> 00:06:46.222
I win, Lieutenant.
Now keep your promise.

00:06:51.105 --> 00:06:55.166
Well, Captain? Will you
make it a direct order?

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:59.841
S-s-sure thing.
Captain's orders. Okay.

00:07:00.114 --> 00:07:03.015
I feel really sorry
for you, Andressen.

00:07:03.117 --> 00:07:05.881
Oh, well. You only have
to do it for 24 hours.

00:07:07.121 --> 00:07:08.110
You, too, Captain.

00:07:08.356 --> 00:07:10.916
Huh? Me, too? Why?

00:07:11.359 --> 00:07:15.352
Oh, didn't I say?
ALL crew members have to do this.

00:07:16.097 --> 00:07:17.029
You mean?

00:07:24.338 --> 00:07:26.272
Nice design, isn't it?

00:07:27.141 --> 00:07:28.608
It looks ancient.

00:07:29.143 --> 00:07:30.132
Is it accurate?

00:07:30.411 --> 00:07:32.072
I guarantee it.

00:07:32.146 --> 00:07:37.106
It's set to sound a siren
in exactly 24 hours.

00:07:38.152 --> 00:07:40.450
All right, Captain?

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.958
I gave my word. Okay, start it.

00:08:04.479 --> 00:08:05.969
Do we do it?

00:08:06.848 --> 00:08:07.837
We promised.

00:08:07.982 --> 00:08:11.179
No choice then.
Let's start cleaning.

00:08:15.857 --> 00:08:20.487
I used to use this hourglass to see
how long I could stay on the wagon.

00:08:21.062 --> 00:08:23.326
Of course, it never worked.

00:08:26.801 --> 00:08:28.962
Well, time to get
back on the wagon.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:31.339
No drinking or
smoking while on duty.

00:08:31.339 --> 00:08:34.604
Even surgeons have
to follow the rules.

00:08:37.745 --> 00:08:41.374
Well, I'd better go
see how everyone's doing.

00:08:50.525 --> 00:08:52.686
Captain, where are you going?

00:08:53.895 --> 00:08:56.056
To check on the others, too.

00:08:57.164 --> 00:08:58.222
Captain!

00:08:59.767 --> 00:09:05.364
A proper captain is dignified and
always ready for the next battle!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:08.038
Like the expression
"steady as a mountain!"

00:09:08.476 --> 00:09:10.808
Steady as a mountain, huh?

00:09:31.732 --> 00:09:36.863
The Soyokaze crew I know would
sooner die than do this!

00:09:42.276 --> 00:09:43.971
Everyone's changed completely!

00:09:44.078 --> 00:09:47.514
How do I report
this to Captain Dom?

00:10:03.598 --> 00:10:07.034
Wow! It's so clean now!

00:10:07.602 --> 00:10:09.593
THIS is the Soyokaze?!

00:10:10.605 --> 00:10:12.368
This is great!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:15.803
I hope it stays this
way longer than 24 hours.

00:10:20.314 --> 00:10:21.076
Captain!

00:10:22.583 --> 00:10:25.848
Commander Star, you've
completely transformed this ship.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.320
It's all thanks to the
rules which you laid down.

00:10:31.459 --> 00:10:33.654
Well, I'M not happy!

00:10:34.328 --> 00:10:37.764
Oh, God, what I wouldn't
do for a drink!

00:10:39.333 --> 00:10:41.733
What do we do
with all this garbage?

00:10:48.609 --> 00:10:52.101
Energy reaction 0.64 light
seconds ahead, bearing to port!

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:53.704
It's a Raalgon fleet!

00:10:54.015 --> 00:10:57.551
A total of 14 ships!
1 cruiser and 13 destroyers!

00:10:57.551 --> 00:10:58.813
Evasive action impossible!

00:11:00.321 --> 00:11:00.844
Captain!

00:11:01.722 --> 00:11:03.986
The Soyokaze by itself
can't handle that many!

00:11:04.225 --> 00:11:07.592
We have to gain distance and
buy as much time as possible!

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.394
Captain!

00:11:28.315 --> 00:11:29.145
Captain!

00:11:35.356 --> 00:11:36.584
CAPTAIN!

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:41.119
As steady as a mountain...

00:11:43.698 --> 00:11:44.630
We stay.

00:11:45.366 --> 00:11:48.631
You're not going to
surrender again, are you?

00:11:49.904 --> 00:11:52.338
A mountain neither
runs nor hides!

00:11:53.774 --> 00:11:56.072
Now, then, shall we get ready?

00:11:58.646 --> 00:12:00.273
Oh, Mr. Yamamoto?

00:12:20.434 --> 00:12:22.698
Captain... Are you serious?

00:12:27.108 --> 00:12:29.872
We have caught up
with the enemy destroyer.

00:12:30.745 --> 00:12:34.476
Captain Dom! The enemy vessel
has shut down its engines!

00:12:34.715 --> 00:12:35.409
What?

00:12:38.352 --> 00:12:40.684
Any change in
its energy systems?

00:12:41.122 --> 00:12:42.714
No, sir. Wha?!

00:12:51.132 --> 00:12:52.793
What is this?!

00:12:58.105 --> 00:13:00.096
Lieutenant, why the fireworks?

00:13:01.142 --> 00:13:05.772
The captain ordered it.
Commander, I think he's...

00:13:14.655 --> 00:13:15.883
Forgive my delay.

00:13:27.668 --> 00:13:28.362
Lt. Kim!

00:13:28.669 --> 00:13:29.897
Y-yes, sir?!

00:13:30.538 --> 00:13:33.837
Open a hotline
to the enemy commander.

00:13:34.208 --> 00:13:35.072
Aye, sir.

00:13:37.144 --> 00:13:38.668
Dress whites?

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:42.672
So, he's prepared to go
down with the Soyokaze!

00:13:43.517 --> 00:13:46.008
What a valiant decision!

00:13:46.854 --> 00:13:49.186
Is this really Tylor?

00:13:53.194 --> 00:13:56.322
Captain! The enemy
destroyer is hailing us.

00:13:56.797 --> 00:13:57.764
Patch it through.

00:14:02.102 --> 00:14:03.296
Your name, please?

00:14:03.838 --> 00:14:09.140
Captain Justy Ueki Tylor of
the UPSF destroyer Soyokaze.

00:14:10.211 --> 00:14:12.008
This is Tylor?!

00:14:13.814 --> 00:14:15.941
Forgive my not
introducing myself.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:21.816
Holy Raalgon Empire space fleet,
27th galactic frontier division.

00:14:21.889 --> 00:14:24.756
66th special detached fleet.

00:14:25.092 --> 00:14:28.425
Captain of the cruiser Doroume.
Ru Baraba Dom.

00:14:30.231 --> 00:14:32.222
Your kind
introduction honors me.

00:14:39.874 --> 00:14:43.071
Do you not feel as I do?

00:14:43.244 --> 00:14:48.682
That our meeting like this,
in the great vastness of space...

00:14:48.749 --> 00:14:52.776
...in the eternal flow of time,
is somehow not accidental?

00:14:54.255 --> 00:14:55.916
I quite agree, sir.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:59.823
It is indeed a pleasure and a
privilege to meet Captain Tylor...

00:14:59.894 --> 00:15:03.193
...whose exploits have carried
his name to us as well.

00:15:03.764 --> 00:15:06.392
I'm honored that you know my name.

00:15:07.234 --> 00:15:09.600
Now, what may I do for you?

00:15:10.604 --> 00:15:14.335
We wish to prepare ourselves
to fight for our lives.

00:15:15.609 --> 00:15:19.272
Magnificent!
He's completely changed!

00:15:19.613 --> 00:15:22.173
He doesn't fear death even
in his final moments!

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.911
Captain Tylor! You are what
every soldier should be!

00:15:27.788 --> 00:15:31.588
Therefore, before our battle
commences, may we have some time?

00:15:36.931 --> 00:15:39.263
As you wish.
I am impressed by...

00:15:39.333 --> 00:15:42.564
...the sparkling, polished
look of the Soyokaze...

00:15:42.636 --> 00:15:47.596
...and by the valiance
of its captain's crew.

00:15:47.942 --> 00:15:49.842
Please, you flatter me.

00:15:50.644 --> 00:15:56.913
Very well. In one hour,
all my ships will launch flares.

00:15:57.318 --> 00:16:01.914
I am truly grateful that you
have granted our request.

00:16:02.156 --> 00:16:04.920
Until then, we will both
prepare as best we can...

00:16:04.992 --> 00:16:09.588
...and then fight with all our
strength when the flares are fired.

00:16:10.264 --> 00:16:12.289
Yes. Until later, then.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.271
But, on the Soyokaze is...

00:16:40.995 --> 00:16:44.988
Captain Dom, the mood on
board is strangely calm.

00:16:45.666 --> 00:16:46.598
Almost as if...

00:16:46.667 --> 00:16:50.660
As if they
were prepared to die?

00:16:51.872 --> 00:16:52.566
Yes, sir.

00:16:53.307 --> 00:16:54.171
I see.

00:16:55.709 --> 00:16:58.007
Captain Dom...
May victory be yours.

00:17:07.021 --> 00:17:11.515
I shall give the Soyokaze
a fitting final battle.

00:17:19.066 --> 00:17:23.696
This is the well-run Soyokaze
I so wanted to see.

00:17:24.972 --> 00:17:29.534
It's a shame we'll be dead
soon, but it was worth it.

00:17:30.978 --> 00:17:32.002
Captain!

00:17:34.748 --> 00:17:37.581
Captain, the enemy fleet
commander is hailing us.

00:17:38.285 --> 00:17:39.343
Patch it through, please.

00:17:40.754 --> 00:17:44.485
Captain Tylor, we still have
some time until our battle.

00:17:44.758 --> 00:17:45.417
Indeed.

00:17:45.926 --> 00:17:50.420
Until then, I wish to
share a drink with you.

00:17:50.764 --> 00:17:54.256
So, the Raalgon Empire has
this custom as well.

00:17:54.568 --> 00:17:55.796
Will you join me?

00:17:55.969 --> 00:17:58.301
Yes. With pleasure.

00:18:03.043 --> 00:18:03.941
Here, sir!

00:18:05.012 --> 00:18:07.003
Thank you, Mr. Yamamoto.

00:18:13.454 --> 00:18:14.614
Captain!

00:18:16.457 --> 00:18:18.618
I know.
Nothing need be said.

00:18:21.795 --> 00:18:25.492
Uh, mind if I joined you?

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:26.896
Doctor!

00:18:40.314 --> 00:18:42.339
To our coming, glorious battle!

00:18:42.583 --> 00:18:47.247
And to Ru Baraba Dom, young
warrior of the Raalgon Empire.

00:18:47.788 --> 00:18:49.722
And finally,
to he whose name shall...

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:52.418
...be written in the war record
of the Holy Raalgon Empire:

00:18:52.593 --> 00:18:54.493
Captain Justy Ueki Tylor!

00:18:54.828 --> 00:18:55.886
Cheers.

00:19:00.834 --> 00:19:02.597
Oh, time's up.

00:19:06.073 --> 00:19:09.804
That's the signal to attack.
Shoot! Shoot for all you're worth!

00:19:10.477 --> 00:19:11.501
Let's go!

00:19:20.821 --> 00:19:22.516
Now! Fire!

00:19:41.842 --> 00:19:44.606
All right!
We've got them pinned down!

00:19:45.812 --> 00:19:47.973
We can do what
we want to them, guys!

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.964
Sensors off-line!
Damage level unknown!

00:20:07.901 --> 00:20:09.994
What the devil's going on?!

00:20:13.907 --> 00:20:17.468
Shall we continue? Cheers!

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:27.281
Yum! Mr. Yamamoto,
another glass, please.

00:20:48.775 --> 00:20:51.869
The Soyokaze has withdrawn.
Unable to track them.

00:20:51.945 --> 00:20:54.880
Our fleet is surrounded
by a large number of...

00:20:54.948 --> 00:20:57.883
...unknown objects of
enemy origin. We cannot move!

00:20:57.951 --> 00:20:59.578
I really fell for it.

00:21:03.223 --> 00:21:08.456
But that may have been the
only way out of that situation.

00:21:09.196 --> 00:21:12.188
"A talented captain
builds a good crew..."

00:21:12.266 --> 00:21:14.894
"...and a good crew brings
out the captain's talents."

00:21:15.068 --> 00:21:16.933
How true those words are.

00:21:18.939 --> 00:21:22.238
Tylor won because of his
skill in handling his men.

00:21:31.551 --> 00:21:33.143
Maybe this is for the best.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.689
I'd say it is.

00:21:46.667 --> 00:21:51.434
There's really no connection
between victory and rules, you know.

00:21:59.279 --> 00:22:00.507
It's for the best.

00:22:01.348 --> 00:22:02.440
Or is it?

00:22:12.492 --> 00:22:13.481
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:14.861 --> 00:22:17.261
Assassination. A beauty contest.
A treacherous angel.

00:22:17.364 --> 00:22:21.494
But, from cradle to grave,
Tylor lets nothing faze him.

00:22:21.835 --> 00:22:24.565
Next time, "Life Is Short,
So Girls Should Kill."

00:22:24.905 --> 00:22:25.372
Watch for it.

00:22:25.372 --> 00:22:25.772
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound
Watch for it.

00:22:25.772 --> 00:22:27.239
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:38.385 --> 00:22:41.488
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:41.488 --> 00:22:44.582
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:45.092 --> 00:22:48.562
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:48.562 --> 00:22:51.395
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:51.898 --> 00:22:54.735
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:54.735 --> 00:22:58.535
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:59.339 --> 00:23:01.708
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:01.708 --> 00:23:05.542
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:09.015 --> 00:23:11.813
Take a deep breath, and one two.
12345 Ikizugi o One Two

00:23:12.953 --> 00:23:15.288
Now stride out...
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:15.288 --> 00:23:18.451
...with your head held high.
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:18.592 --> 00:23:22.323
Downtown Dance
